{"id":80,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自然環境と自立を重視するセルフリーダーシップ教育","feature_description":"八王子の自然豊かなキャンパスで、教育理念のもとセルフリーダーシップを育てています。中学校では学習習慣と確かな学力の定着を目指し、学校行事や部活動とのバランスを大切にします。高校では特別進学・総合進学・共立進学・英語の各コースで、自ら設定した目標と希望進路の実現に向けて取り組みます。自然豊かな環境や多様な学校生活を通じて、生徒の個性と自立した行動を支えます。","clubs":[{"id":1397,"name":"和躾（なごみ）部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1398,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1400,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1401,"name":"サウンドソサエティ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1403,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1405,"name":"美術部・漫画研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1407,"name":"野外研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1409,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1410,"name":"少林寺拳法部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1411,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1412,"name":"体操競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1413,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/ni